---
layout: base.njk
title: Chat with my CV
permalink: /chat/
description: Ask an AI assistant trained on João Silva's CV, website and university page.
---
{% set intro = cv.chat.intro %}
{% include "page-head.njk" %}
<div class="wrap page-body chat-layout">
  <div class="chat-main">
    {% if cv.chat.iframe_src %}
    <div class="chat-frame">
      <iframe src="{{ cv.chat.iframe_src }}" title="João Silva CV Assistant" allow="clipboard-write" loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="notice">
      <h2>The assistant is being set up</h2>
      <p>Until it's ready, write to me at <a href="mailto:{{ cv.profile.email }}">{{ cv.profile.email }}</a>.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if cv.chat.bot_url %}
    <p class="meta">Prefer a full window? <a href="{{ cv.chat.bot_url }}">Open the assistant on its own page</a>.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <aside class="chat-side">
    <h2>Things you could ask</h2>
    <ul class="ask-list">
      <li>Where does João study, and what?</li>
      <li>What did João build at FlyRank.ai and Mindshaker?</li>
      <li>Which AI projects has João worked on?</li>
      <li lang="pt">Que línguas fala o João?</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="meta">The assistant answers from three sources: this website, the Polytechnic Institute of Beja course page, and my CV.</p>
  </aside>
</div>
